FlyBuds C1 / FlyBuds C2 / SolarBuds C2 / MoveBuds H1 / FlyBuds C1 Pro / OpenGo / QuietPlus 81 / StormBox Blast / StormBox Micro 2 / Upgraded StormBox Pro / AquaEase / XSound Mega / StormBox Flow / StormBox 2 / XSound Plus 2 / StormBox Blast 2 / StormBox Lava / StormBox Mini+ / PocketGo;
Tribit App is a set of mobile terminal operating software based on Bluetooth audio equipment, providing systematic, data-based and intelligent services. 
App features:
- Connect and manage headphones or speaker devices；
- Get and update device firmware;
- Personalized, easy to adjust EQ;
- Provide efficient product support and customer service;
If you encounter any problems during use, you can contact 【support@tribit.com】, thank you for your understanding and support.

